{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/944754-herding-the-infant-ape-red-talon-gift-question","id":944754,"title":"Herding the Infant Ape; Red Talon gift question","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-08-06T01:20:41-07:00","id":944754,"title":"Herding the Infant Ape; Red Talon gift question","content":"So one of my players (who is a red talon) knows about this gift through his dead mother and while not being able to do it himself it is likely he would find a red talon who could cast it onto a baby that was just found.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.wyrmfoe.com/1946/herding-the-infant-ape/\" target=\"_blank\">The wording however is a bit unclear .</a>.. how is a city defined? does it need a certain population or are villages in there as well... has anyone ever used this gift in their games? How did it work out for you!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8249-crytash","name":"Crytash","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8249_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"386"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-06T03:47:09-07:00","id":944774,"title":"","content":"City is poorly defined. But it's a Talon Gift, which means it isn't really meant to be. If you need some sort of rules guide, anywhere with a base Gauntlet rating of 6+ would be off limits (7 is average for a city, and 6 would be borderline) is too &quot;city&quot; for the child.<br /> <br /> Of course, I've never seen it used outside of NPCs, because it's a shoddy waste of XP. There's just so many better things to spent 9 XP on. IMO this should be a Rite, not a Gift.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-06T09:19:54-07:00","id":944886,"title":"","content":"Geat idea! And yeah, it would be a NPC with the gift and i even talked about it with my PC that i felt this should be a rite too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8249-crytash","name":"Crytash","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8249_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"386"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-06T13:46:06-07:00","id":945040,"title":"","content":"Two gifts I've asked on myself never gotten a clear answer<br /> <br /> &quot;Mark of the Wolf&quot; and &quot;Bury the wolf&quot;<br /> <br /> The First allows a Garou to Saddle a Normal human with the curse.<br /> <br /> the Second allows a Garou a brief Respite from it.<br /> <br /> What I want to know is the implications of how previous interactions would affect what you now feel , or do not feel from them<br /> <br /> <br /> when the guy you've known for years hanged out in the bar with etc, suddenly gives off this aura of menace...<br /> <br /> or when this guy, that while you dont know of them to have ever done something illegal, theirs something Wrong with them suddenly seems so approachable and friendly...<br /> <br /> how do you think either of those cases could work.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-06T14:09:08-07:00","id":945052,"title":"","content":"What would you do in that situation?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-06T14:45:18-07:00","id":945072,"title":"","content":"In either Case I'd probaly be questioning either way if I'd misjudged them.<br /> <br /> If they were a Friend or Family member I'd probaly want to give them &quot;the benefit of a doubt&quot; <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"